# .gitignore — production/src/
#
# Template-owned; copier update keeps it current. Project-wide rules belong in the root .gitignore.
# No inline comments in this file: Git reads a # after a pattern as part of the pattern.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Masters and card renders
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Built by the toolkit from the tracked edit decision lists, cards, footage manifest and
# voiceover registers: regenerable, and too large for plain Git. The README stays tracked, so
# the folder and its note on what lands in it survive a fresh clone.
/renders/*
!/renders/README.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The local mirror of source media
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Footage lives in external storage by decision and is listed, with its checksum, in
# footage/manifest.toml; raw/ holds this machine's copies, which footage verify proves.
/footage/raw/*
!/footage/raw/README.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated voiceover
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ElevenLabs takes: paid for, impossible to make again identically, and too large for plain
# Git. An approved take is archived as source media, never committed.
/voiceover/generated/*
!/voiceover/generated/README.md

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated narration and mastered chapters
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Chapter text chunks, their takes and the mastered chapters. The rules sit here rather than
# inside audiobook/ because production/src/ ships with every project: removing the audiobook
# media kind removes the template's files from audiobook/ but keeps your chapter registers and
# any audio beside them, and these rules go on keeping that audio and that text out of Git.
/audiobook/generated/*
!/audiobook/generated/README.md
/audiobook/renders/*
!/audiobook/renders/README.md
